  "name": "Scallop & Peach Ceviche",
  "text": "Scallop & Peach Ceviche\n\nPreparation time: 30 minutes\n\nCooking time: none\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\n8 scallops (coral removed).\n\n3 limes,\n\n1/2 red onion (grated),\n\n3 peaches (stoned and chopped into small pieces),\n\n1 tbsp fresh tarragon (chopped),\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Slice each scallop horizontally into four disks,\n\n2. Place the scallop slices into a bowl with the lime juice and zest, peaches, tarragon, and a pinch of salt.\n\n3. Stir, cover with cling film and put in the fridge for 20 minutes.",
  "prepTime": "PT30M",
  "cookTime": "PT0M",
  "recipeYield": "4",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "8 scallops (coral removed).",
    "3 limes,",
    "1/2 red onion (grated),",
    "3 peaches (stoned and chopped into small pieces),",
    "1 tbsp fresh tarragon (chopped),"
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "1. Slice each scallop horizontally into four disks,"
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "2. Place the scallop slices into a bowl with the lime juice and zest, peaches, tarragon, and a pinch of salt."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Stir, cover with cling film and put in the fridge for 20 minutes."
    }
  ]
